    "A 2-second “Made with Shotnix” outro on your background — your own outro card is in Style" : {
      "comment" : "Keep “Made with Shotnix” in English: the end card shows it that way in every language",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein 2 Sekunden langes Outro „Made with Shotnix“ auf deinem Hintergrund – deine eigene Outro-Karte findest du unter „Stil“"
